Got it - you need to add the `IS_SANDBOX` environment variable to your Claude Code plugin settings first. The setting should look like:

```json
"claudeCode.environmentVariables": [
    {
        "name": "IS_SANDBOX",
        "value": "1"
    }
]
```

This will allow the spawned agents to bypass the sandbox and run Docker commands. Let me know once you've updated the setting and reloaded, and I'll relaunch the build team.

